OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 13 FEB
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens showcases the
OL,6,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,7,     Gbeyond, including Saint-Saens's
OL,8,     GPiano Concerto No. 2 and
OL,9,     GDebussy's Suite from Pelleas et
OL,10,     GMelisande.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Schutz
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod explores the final
OL,13,     Gyears for the celebrated composer
OL,14,     GHeinrich Schutz, when he received
OL,15,     Ga sudden windfall of a generous
OL,16,     Gpension.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,19,     Gmusic from baroque Ensemble
OL,20,     GMusica d'Outrora. He is also
OL,21,     Gjoined by pianist Kathryn Stott
OL,22,     Glive in studio.
