OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 13 FEB
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,7,     Gincluding music from Tchaikovsky,
OL,8,     GFaure, Florence Price, and film
OL,9,     Gcomposer George Fenton.
OL,10,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,11,     GMichael Seal conducts the BBC
OL,12,     GConcert Orchestra in Chichester,
OL,13,     Gfeaturing music by composers who
OL,14,     Galso had alternative careers,
OL,15,     Gboth inside and outside the
OL,16,     Gmusical profession.
OL,17,G2145FThe Essay: Vivaldi in a Warming
OL,18,     FWorld
OL,19,     GKate Molleson draws together
OL,20,     GVivaldi's work within the context
OL,21,     Gof human-made climate change.
